reading the chart
  acts   enter open · + zoom in · - zoom out · T today · . notes · f filter by
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, g g first row, G / g e last row]
  full   [→/l later, ←/h earlier]
  full   [enter open this issue, + zoom in to a shorter period, - zoom out to a longer period, T centre the chart on today, . where these dates came from, f filter by a person, a status, a label]
narrowed by a term
  acts   enter open · + zoom in · - zoom out · T today · . notes · f filter by · ctrl+g clear
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, g g first row, G / g e last row]
  full   [→/l later, ←/h earlier]
  full   [enter open this issue, + zoom in to a shorter period, - zoom out to a longer period, T centre the chart on today, . where these dates came from, f filter by a person, a status, a label, ctrl+g clear filter]
nothing to chart
